# Files the Vercel CLI must NOT upload.
#
# Why this file exists (2026-10-23): a deploy failed with
# "File size limit exceeded (100 MB)" because the local dev server's
# Turbopack artifacts grew past the limit —
#   .next/dev/logs/next-development.log   351 MB
#   .next/dev/cache/turbopack/*.sst        52-122 MB each
# `.next/` is git-ignored, but Vercel CLI uploads the working
# directory, not the git tree. Without this file a long-running dev
# session silently breaks the next deploy.
.next/
node_modules/
.git/
.vercel/

# Local scratch
*.log
dev-*.log
smoke-out.txt
build*.log
